  <title>Geometry for Post-primary School Mathematics</title>
  <introduction>
    <p>Below is the complete fifty-page official Appendix B, reproduced in source order as scalable vector pages within this book, including every original drawing, theorem, proof, construction, and syllabus summary. Use the contents to open the individual sections and source pages. This complete source-page edition is not yet a fully semantic PreTeXt transcription of each statement. The final three sections following it are an earlier partial transcription, preserved temporarily so existing links to Definitions 1–11 and Axioms 1–2 continue to work.</p>
  </introduction>
